ality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1Style: Pekoms - Infobox,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Map,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: NonePlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:54.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't think that you'll be able to survive...Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:56.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,after making the entire world your enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:02:01.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:07.77,Title,,0,0,250,,Jump into the Waterfall!!Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:13.73,Captions,,975,0,310,,Plaza Outside the CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:02:13.73,0:02:18.74,Captions,,950,0,335,,Left Tower (Mozu and Lulu)Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:24.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! We pulled the lever!Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We did it-waina!Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:32.72,Captions,,0,930,290,,Right Tower (Kiwi and Tilestone)Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:39.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like Mozu and the others got it done, too-waina. Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:42.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.64,Main,,0,0,0,,The drawbridge is coming down!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:51.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like they pulled through.Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Good timing.Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:02:59.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm trembling with anticipation!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Lower that bridge already.Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You look evil.Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:09.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't stop until we rescue you! Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay over there! Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.63,Main,,0,0,0,,They're in high spirits.Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:22.03,Main,,0,0,0,,To think that they don't fear the flag of the government...Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:23.59,Main,,0,0,0,,How pointless.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:26.76,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way that they could defeat us.Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:29.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you cross!Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The drawbridge is coming down!Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:33.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Go! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:36.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Curse those pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:39.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Like we'd let that happen! Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Get the mortar ready! Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop the drawbridge! Break it if you have to!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:46.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you do that!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:48.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Pipe Hitch Knives!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:51.22,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the end of you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Demolition Chop!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.77,0:04:17.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice Baskerville!Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:22.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad!Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:24.70,Main,,0,0,0,,We're actually the chief justice trio!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:26.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I, the left Baskerville, am named Bas!Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:33.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I, the right Baskerville, am named Kerville!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:36.58,Main,,0,0,0,,And I, the center Baskerville, go by the name...Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:37.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess!Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What're ya talkin' about?! Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:42.75,Main,,0,0,0,,So they were just stuck together?Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:44.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What for?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:47.22,Main,,0,0,0,,We're good friends!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:51.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire the mortar! Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:04.07,Main,,0,0,0,,The drawbridge stopped?! Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:05.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Gettin' in our way! Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Those bastards! Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:10.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Who did this?! Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:14.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandam!Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:17.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Please evacuate from the Tower of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Good job!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:30.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna head to the Gates of Justice before they come over to this side!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:32.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Come, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:34.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone! Bring Cutty Flam!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:36.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Those pirates are nobodies. Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got the assassin group CP9 on my side!Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:49.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, a survivor of the island of scholars...Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,who schemed to bring back the ancient weapons... Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:57.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam, who inherited an ancient weapon's blueprints...Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:06:02.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely not gonna stand back and miss this opportunity to gain more power!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.74,0:06:09.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam...Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:18.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:20.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey... don't tell me...Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:26.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are the ancient weapon Pluton's blueprints...!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,They're the real deal.Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:30.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you believe me?Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucci... Kaku... You guys can tell, right?Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought it was unlikely...Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:55.56,Main,,0,0,0,,So you were hiding them inside your body, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,T-The real ones?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Are those the real ones?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hand them over... Hand them over to me!Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:08.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are my long sought-after blueprints! Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:09.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:15.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Rumors are such unreliable things, aren't they?Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:19.48,Main,,0,0,0,,While we were being brought to this damn place,Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I came to realize that you aren't some devil... Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:24.18,Main,,0,0,0,,who's trying to misuse the weapon.Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:31.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The Water 7 shipwrights haven't been passing down... Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:34.58,Main,,0,0,0,,for generations just how to build the weapon. Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.59,0:07:39.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Tom-san achieved so many great things...Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:42.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,and gave up everything to preserve these blueprints for the future. Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:44.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,At any rate, as long as there's a risk... Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.51,0:07:47.44,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,that a woman named Nico Robin can restore the weapon,Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:51.32,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,the world needs those blueprints to fight back.Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:55.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Spanda.Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:59.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What Tom-san and Iceburg risked their lives to protect is...Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hand them over to me already!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:03.69,Main,,0,0,0,,the wish of this weapon's architect— Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:07.71,Main,,0,0,0,,that is, if the ancient weapon fell into the hands of an idiot like you...Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:10.37,Main,,0,0,0,,and started being used to cause trouble,Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:13.76,Main,,0,0,0,,the architect would want another weapon to be built in order to stop it. Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.44,0:08:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true that if you use Nico Robin, you can revive the ancient weapon.Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:21.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if she doesn't want to help you,Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.13,0:08:23.78,Main,,0,0,0,,as long as there's a chance that she could be used,Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.78,0:08:25.73,Main,,0,0,0,,she's still dangerous.Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.73,0:08:28.31,Main,,0,0,0,,But she's got friends...Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.31,0:08:32.26,Main,,0,0,0,,who are willing to risk their lives to protect her.Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:33.49,Main,,0,0,0,,So I'll...Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.91,0:08:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,take a chance!Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:38.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I can think of only one way... Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,to uphold the architect's wish in this situation.Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:46.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and hand them over to me already!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are mine!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:52.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:07.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:10.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It's burned to a cinder! Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:19.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Our five-year mission...Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:31.46,Main,,0,0,0,,The blueprints were kept in order to create a weapon to fight back...Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,And you, the government, came after them a second time.Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:38.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Essentially, something like this should remain a secret,Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:41.51,Main,,0,0,0,,and so once it's revealed, it has to be eliminated.Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:46.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, there's no longer a power to fight back against the ancient weapon.Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:48.95,Main,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done and Nico Robin falls into your hands,Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,it'll be hopeless.Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:53.11,Main,,0,0,0,,But if the Straw Hats win...Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:57.96,Main,,0,0,0,,there won't be anything left to you at all.Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:01.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I made a bet on their victory.Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.91,0:10:04.41,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock me...?Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like you want to die here, too, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:11.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:14.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:18.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:19.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:20.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Bro is at the Tower of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:22.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Good! He's fine!Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Bro-waina! Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:25.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,We came to rescue you-waina! Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:31.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We came with the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:33.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Sodom and Gomorrah fought hard, too!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:35.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:37.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Come home with us! Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:39.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:42.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Y... You guys...Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiots...Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.07,0:10:47.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Who asked you to come...Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:51.28,Main,,0,0,0,,to come rescue me?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiots!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:11:00.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Bastards! I'm not crying!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:11.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you, a demon?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.19,0:11:14.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin's waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:16.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and bring down the bridge!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right.Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, you bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.38,0:11:24.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, you guys! Or I'm gonna beat you up!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, you're right.Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:29.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I like when you're inconsistent like that, too, Nami-san! Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.87,0:11:31.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:36.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like you looked out for my underlings. Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.41,0:11:38.30,Main,,0,0,0,,But this time,Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:40.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I, their boss, the great Franky,Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:43.30,Main,,0,0,0,,will add my super fighting power to you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:45.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Do what you want! Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:49.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm still holding what you did to Usopp against you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:52.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Err... well, he's right next to you...Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:55.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam...Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:58.58,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you...Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:02.32,Main,,0,0,0,,burn my blueprints?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.74,0:12:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:19.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Bro is falling into the falls!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.23,0:12:22.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:24.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Kokoro-san?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard everything!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:28.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you guys wasting time for?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:29.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Wasting time?Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.41,0:12:31.35,Main,,0,0,0,,But the bridge is only halfway down.Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.35,0:12:34.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Halfway is good enough!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:36.81,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be there in four seconds.Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Just dive in toward the falls! Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,That's... from earlier...!Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:48.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that the granny?Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:49.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What does she mean?Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:52.20,Main,,0,0,0,,But she said jump toward the falls. Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:00.77,Main,,0,0,0,,T-The sea train?! Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.77,0:13:02.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is it in the courthouse?! Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:07.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Chimney, go ahead and give that whistle a yank. Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:08.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:13.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That sounds like the sea train... Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.49,0:13:18.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of that smile?Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:19.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:21.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Please get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.11,0:13:25.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:37.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:45.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Nooo!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:50.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Rocketman can still run!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:54.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate Tom's Workers,Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.46,0:13:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,the legendary shipbuilders! Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:01.94,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Rocketman?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:09.82,Main,,0,0,0,,It's flying again!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:25.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:27.59,Main,,0,0,0,,They're coming!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:33.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a waterfall!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.91,0:14:40.68,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This brings back memories, doesn't it, Tom-san?Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:47.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,About helping that Roger guy... Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:51.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm DAMN proud that I did! Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:52.37,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:54.22,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm the man who'll be the pirate king.Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:54.85,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:55.37,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:59.29,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Roger...Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:02.82,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,was an idiot like this kid, too, wasn't he? Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:07.06,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,And you helped him out.Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.06,0:15:08.99,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Seems like we didn't learn our lesson.Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:14.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Everyone in Tom's Workers is helping this pirate kid.Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.74,0:15:20.73,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You would've done the same, wouldn't you, Tom-san?Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:31.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna hit the wall! Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:34.07,Main,,0,0,0,,W-We're gonna crash!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:51.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.17,0:16:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,They're here...Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:09.81,Main,,0,0,0,,They're here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.81,0:16:11.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:12.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, come with me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:18.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If only I could get these seastone handcuffs off... Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm letting you loose, CP9! Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:28.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Beat the crap out of them here, in the Tower of Justice! Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:32.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give you permission to destroy them! Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucci! Come with me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:37.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Protecting my life is your top priority!Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:39.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Got that?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:40.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Funkfreed!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, good boy.Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:57.87,Captions,,0,0,275,,Elephant Sword Funkfreed Elephant-Elephant FruitDialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:02.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got this treasured sword, in addition to CP9.Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,When I calm down and think, I've got nothing to be afraid of. Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's head to the Gates of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:12.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and get this woman back if you can, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:15.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Franky is okay!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:19.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats have finally reached the Tower of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:21.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Bro is no longer a prisoner!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's gonna join in the fight!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! He's that kind of person!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:27.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Get them, Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:30.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Go! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:33.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We're leaving the rest to you, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.85,0:17:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Kokoro, you old hag?! Little ones?! Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you come here for,Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:46.44,Main,,0,0,0,,bringing out a dangerous thing like Rocketman?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Well, it saved me, too, but...Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:51.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, Old Hag! Hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! I beg you! Don't die!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:55.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't die!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:09.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got a nosebleed.Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you walk away from this sort of crash with just a nosebleed?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:15.41,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! We're here!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:17.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.13,0:18:21.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Monster Granny!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:24.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! Get up already!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.31,0:18:25.99,Main,,0,0,0,,That was nothing!Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:29.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You're rubber. Don't lump us in with you. Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Us flesh-and-blood humans were forced to charge in like that.Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You think we're okay...?Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:40.61,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:42.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Yup, they're all fine.Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.14,0:18:44.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are all weirdos, too, so...Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Just sayin'.Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:48.30,Main,,0,0,0,,There are stairs over there!Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:50.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and catch up to Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:58.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait.Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:02.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:03.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapapapa...Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.99,0:19:06.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We have been invaded. Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:08.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you go to the room you saw earlier,Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:10.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin isn't there anymore,Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:13.37,Main,,0,0,0,,since Lucci took her to the Gates of Justice.Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:14.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:16.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, and our chief is there, too. Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:22.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for giving us such valuable information.Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:25.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapapa... I spilled the beans...Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:27.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What a funny guy.Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:28.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.80,0:19:30.92,Main,,0,0,0,,They're headed there right now,Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:32.91,Main,,0,0,0,,but I won't tell you how to get there,Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.91,0:19:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,and we, CP9, won't let you go there, either.Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.78,0:19:39.74,Main,,0,0,0,,We have an order to annihilate you guys.Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:41.61,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Annihilation order...?Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Unless you defeat us, Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:47.82,Main,,0,0,0,,you won't be able to set Nico Robin free.Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:48.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.61,0:19:51.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell us that. We're gonna do it anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapapa...Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:54.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What a high-spirited guy.Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,But let me tell you one more thing.Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:59.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Do as you wish.Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:01.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, thanks.Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.87,0:20:03.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll speak frankly.Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at this!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,A key?Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:08.43,Main,,0,0,0,,What for?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:11.69,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the key to unlock...Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,the seastone handcuffs on Nico Robin! Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.73,0:20:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Seastone? Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:19.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a stone that cancels out devil fruit powers. Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:22.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that it's as effective as when ability users fall into the sea. Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:26.08,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's why Robin isn't fighting now,Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.78,Main,,0,0,0,,despite how strong she actually is.Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:29.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.09,0:20:30.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Under normal circumstances,Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.73,0:20:34.47,Main,,0,0,0,,she isn't so weak that she'd helplessly stay held captive by guys like that.Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.47,0:20:36.42,Main,,0,0,0,,She must be feeling frustrated.Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:42.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you guys can rescue Nico Robin by some chance,Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:44.90,Main,,0,0,0,,since seastone is hard like diamonds,Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.90,0:20:48.43,Main,,0,0,0,,the handcuffs will be on her forever.Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:50.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapapa...Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:52.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I spilled the beans again.Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:54.35,Main,,0,0,0,,He really is funny.Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:58.59,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's okay, keep trying to rescue Nico Robin. Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:21:01.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapapapapa!Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:02.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, then...Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,give that to us!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.17,0:21:12.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like he can use that technique, too.Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.35,0:21:14.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hasty.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.31,0:21:18.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't say that this is the right key.Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:25.55,Main,,0,0,0,,It might be...Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:28.46,Main,,0,0,0,,for different handcuffs.Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:30.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapapa papa!Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.39,0:21:33.81,Main,,0,0,0,,There are five CP9 members,Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:38.63,Main,,0,0,0,,including me, in this tower.Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.63,0:21:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Each one has a key...Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:42.25,Secondary,,0,0,0,,One, two, come on!Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:46.24,Main,,0,0,0,,and is waiting for you.Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:44.69,Secondary,,0,0,0,,One, two, bad!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:46.24,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Yow?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:49.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, until we defeat you all and get the keys,Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,and try them on Robin's handcuffs,Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:53.83,Main,,0,0,0,,we won't know which one is the right key?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:56.51,Main,,0,0,0,,How stupid... buying time?Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.51,0:21:57.98,Main,,0,0,0,,While we're fighting,Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:22:01.35,Main,,0,0,0,,you guys are trying to take Robin-chan to the Gates of Justice, aren't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.35,0:22:04.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Quickly catching up with Robin should be our priority. Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:08.81,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll first get Robin back, and then worry about the key.Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.81,0:22:11.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's ignore that weirdo and hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.23,0:22:12.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapa!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:17.64,Note,,0,0,0,,That weirdoDialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:13.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapapa!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You're smart.Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.28,0:22:18.57,Main,,0,0,0,,But if you do that,Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.57,0:22:23.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll ditch this key into the sea! Chapapa!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We're giving you a chance.Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.39,0:22:28.95,Main,,0,0,0,,See ya.Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.46,0:22:31.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! Wait, you jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.53,0:22:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:35.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You wait, dammit! Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.91,0:22:39.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! Just a little bit longer!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:42.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Just wait until we decide what each of us will do!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:45.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.85,0:22:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Straw Hat-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:51.09,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:51.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Lucci that pigeon guy?Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.09,0:22:53.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:55.97,Main,,0,0,0,,If he's with Robin-chan,Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.57,0:22:59.23,Main,,0,0,0,,we should let at least Luffy go on ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:02.98,Main,,0,0,0,,At any rate, you just beat up the pigeon guy.Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.98,0:23:05.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:08.38,Main,,0,0,0,,There are six of us excluding Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:11.26,Main,,0,0,0,,He said there are five CP9 members here.Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:15.14,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll get the five keys for Robin-chan's handcuffs from them and go after Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.40,0:23:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,If Robin-kun goes through the gates, it'll all be over.Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:21.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all a race against time!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If we lose our fights, it means we lose time! Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.75,0:23:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Win at all cost! Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.88,0:23:29.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:32.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Good luck!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate guys!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:43.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Chimney? Gonbe?Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:45.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.90,0:23:48.94,Main,,0,0,0,,They were there up until just a bit ago!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.32,0:23:51.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll bump into them somewhere!Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.24,0:23:54.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you go to the Gates of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:57.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.05,0:24:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Help won't come, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.42,0:24:09.12,Main,,0,0,0,,They don't know how to get to the Gates of Justice in the first place!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.97,0:24:17.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Come out! You pigeon jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.81,0:24:20.31,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad... before I fight...Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.31,0:24:22.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's the kitchen?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.89,0:24:24.85,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Coup de Boo!Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.75,0:24:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I used a bottle and a half of cola for Coup de Boo,Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.54,0:24:32.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I've used more than two bottles today!Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.71,0:24:36.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Unless I fill up all three bottles, I can't fight CP9!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.08,0:24:40.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That area looks like a kitchen!Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.77,0:24:50.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapapapapa...Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.36,0:24:52.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm "Silent Fukuro"...Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.21,0:24:54.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I like rumors!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.57,0:24:56.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want the key?Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.10,0:24:57.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.11,0:24:58.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I still haven't refilled my cola yet!Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.85,0:25:00.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Chapa...!Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.68,0:25:14.52,Main,,0,0,0,,No one was in there.Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.21,0:25:19.43,Main,,0,0,0,,No one's here. Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.75,0:25:23.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm, or here. Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.59,0:25:26.87,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, no one's here. Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.73,0:25:31.26,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What's going on? I can't find anyone anywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.26,0:25:33.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If no one's around, that's fine, though.Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.79,0:25:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,They must've gotten scared of me...Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.88,0:25:42.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahhh...!Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:44.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Someone's here!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:51.97,Main,,0,0,0,,He's sleeping...Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.75,0:25:54.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he part of CP9, too?Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:26:00.12,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He's sleeping with the key right in front of him!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:05.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Couldn't this be a huge, lucky chance?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.91,0:26:10.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what this dungeon-like hallway is?Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.26,0:26:16.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.98,0:26:20.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You damn pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.51,0:26:26.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You're doomed now that I've caught you here!Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:30.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait...Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.10,0:26:34.65,Main,,0,0,0,,a second...!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.69,0:26:37.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.45,0:26:44.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,How annoying... Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.08,0:26:45.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What about this room?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.76,0:26:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.95,0:26:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,No one's here, either.Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.63,0:27:03.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Please make yourself at home.Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.81,0:27:09.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall I... make some tea?Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.79,0:27:25.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:38.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You've already drawn your swords?Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.88,0:27:43.30,Main,,0,0,0,,They're just crying out for blood. Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.30,0:27:46.30,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack, Sewil  Soundtracking: Halee  Title & Infoboxes: Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 2,0:00:00.38,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 2,0:00:00.42,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 2,0:00:00.45,0:00:01.83,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.49,0:00:01.83,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 3,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.48,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,se